# Never commit state, plans, or local provider caches — see assignment safety red lines
# ("state committed to Git" invalidates the submission) and docs/terraform-gate1-design.md §7.

**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
tfplan*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Never commit variable files that might carry secrets
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!example.tfvars
